        "en": "W sam raz"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "A room that is neither big nor small is *w sam raz* (just right). In it: *poduszki* (cushions) on the bed, *ubrania* (clothes) in the wardrobe, a *beżowy* (beige) rug, and *plastikowe gwiazdki* (little plastic stars) on the ceiling that *świecą się* (glow) at night. Where things are: *po lewej stronie*, *po prawej stronie*, *na wprost* (straight ahead), *w rogu*."
      }
    }
